<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-163.1-charging-network-strategy-siting-and-host-partnering" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4769" name="W4769. EV Charging Host-Network Strategy, Business Model &amp; Roadmap" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program launch; annual strategy review; EV adoption inflection; RA 11697 IRR update
Frequency: Annual + on launch
Volume: 1 group strategy; ~2–6 charge points/site → ~400–1,200 ports across ~205 sites
Owner: COO / EV Charging Network Program Manager
Participants: Real Estate (VS-97), Energy (VS-108/VS-120), Finance (VS-17.4), ESG (VS-25), Marketing (VS-14)
Source: workflow W4769 — EV Charging Host-Network Strategy, Business Model &amp; Roadmap</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4769_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4769_Lane1" name="EV Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4769_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4769_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4769_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4769_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4769_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4769_Start3" name="Program launch; annual strategy review; EV adoption inflection; RA 11697 IRR update">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4769_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4769_Task4" name="Set the network strategy &amp; business model: own-operate (BuildRight buys EVSE…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the network strategy &amp; business model: own-operate (BuildRight buys EVSE, sells energy, takes all revenue/risk) vs host-partner (a CPO installs/operates EVSE on BuildRight sites, BuildRight takes lease/host-revenue + traffic) vs hybrid; mix by site economics and EV adoption stage; phase the rollout (Metro Manila/NCR first where EV density is highest per profile store distribution, then CALABARZON, Cebu, Davao)
Responsible (R): EV Program Manager / Finance / Real Estate
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4769_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4769_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4769_Task5" name="Build the strategic case: EV adoption forecast under RA 11697 (fleet EV…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Build the strategic case: EV adoption forecast under RA 11697 (fleet EV mandates, EV incentive scheme), dwell-time basket uplift (EV driver shops 20–45 min while charging), own-solar/storage energy arbitrage (VS-108), decarbonization/ESG contribution (VS-25), property-asset future-proofing, and the host vs own-operate unit economics; define success KPIs (ports, utilization, host-revenue, basket-uplift, tCO₂e enabled)
Responsible (R): EV Program Manager / Finance / ESG
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4769_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4769_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4769_Task6" name="Approve the multi-year roadmap, capex envelope (W4776), and the phase-gate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Approve the multi-year roadmap, capex envelope (W4776), and the phase-gate review cadence; integrate into corporate strategy (VS-33), capex (VS-40/VS-112), and ESG plan (VS-25); sequence with the store-remodel program (VS-109) to embed charging in remodels
Responsible (R): EV Program Manager / PMO / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO / CFO / Board (material capex)
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4769_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4769_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4769_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4769_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4769_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-719 (ensure controlled execution — Charging Network Strategy, Siting &amp; Host Partnering (PA-163.1).) | - CTL-719: annual strategy + business case reviewed by CFO/COO; phased rollout gated on adoption/utilization KPIs; capex via VS-40 gate
Owner: COO / EV Charging Network Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4769_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4769_Annotation8" targetRef="W4769_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4769_Flow10" sourceRef="W4769_Start3" targetRef="W4769_Task4" />
