    <bpmn:process id="W_W4770" name="W4770. Charge-Point-Operator (CPO) &amp; e-Mobility-Service-Partner Selection &amp; Contracting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Host-partner model selected (W4769); CPO contract expiry; expansion to new region
Frequency: Per sourcing event + multi-year contract
Volume: ~1–3 CPO/eMSP partners group-wide (plus own-operate EVSE vendors)
Owner: EV Program Manager / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34) / Legal (VS-100.3)
Participants: CPO/eMSP vendors, Real Estate (VS-97), Finance (VS-17), TPRM (VS-161)
Source: workflow W4770 — Charge-Point-Operator (CPO) &amp; e-Mobility-Service-Partner Selection &amp; Contracting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4770_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4770_Lane1" name="EV Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4770_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4770_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4770_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4770_Lane2" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4770_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4770_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4770_Start4" name="Host-partner model selected (W4769); CPO contract expiry; expansion to new region">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4770_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4770_Task5" name="Define CPO/eMSP partner requirements: EVSE hardware brands/standards…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define CPO/eMSP partner requirements: EVSE hardware brands/standards (CCS2/CHAdeMO/GB/T per PH market, AC Type-2, future NACS), network coverage, OCPP/OCPI compliance, uptime SLA, brand/customer-experience standards, app/roaming integration, and BuildRight site-branding; scope the host lease vs revenue-share structure
Responsible (R): EV Program Manager / Procurement
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4770_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4770_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4770_Task6" name="Run sourcing: RFP, evaluate (technical, commercial, coverage, uptime, TPRM…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run sourcing: RFP, evaluate (technical, commercial, coverage, uptime, TPRM VS-161 cyber/financial/ESG due diligence), negotiate the host agreement (lease/host-revenue, term, exit, performance SLA, branding, data-sharing), and contract via Legal (VS-100.3) with TPRM risk provisions
Responsible (R): Procurement / EV Program Manager / Legal / TPRM
Accountable (A): COO / Legal
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4770_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4770_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4770_Task7" name="Onboard the partner: site-access standards, insurance/indemnity (VS-26)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Onboard the partner: site-access standards, insurance/indemnity (VS-26), data-sharing agreement (RA 10173 VS-91), billing/settlement integration (VS-80), and performance governance; manage the relationship ongoing (W4792) and re-compete at term
Responsible (R): EV Program Manager / Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per partner + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4770_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4770_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4770_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4770_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4770_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-719 (ensure controlled execution — Charging Network Strategy, Siting &amp; Host Partnering (PA-163.1).) | - CTL-719: OCPP/OCPI compliance required; SLA + TPRM cyber DD + DPA in contract; re-compete at term
Owner: EV Program Manager / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34) / Legal (VS-100.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4770_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4770_Annotation9" targetRef="W4770_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
