    <bpmn:process id="W_W4772" name="W4772. Host-Revenue, Lease &amp; Cost-Sharing Commercial Structure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: CPO contracting (W4770); own-operate unit-economics; annual review
Frequency: Per contract + annual
Volume: ~1 commercial framework per model (host-partner / own-operate)
Owner: EV Program Manager / Finance (VS-17.4) / Real Estate (VS-97)
Participants: Finance (VS-17/VS-18), Legal (VS-100.3), CPO, Treasury (VS-18)
Source: workflow W4772 — Host-Revenue, Lease &amp; Cost-Sharing Commercial Structure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4772_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4772_Lane1" name="Finance">
