      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4772_Start3" name="CPO contracting (W4770); own-operate unit-economics; annual review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4772_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4772_Task4" name="Design the commercial structure per model: host-partner (fixed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the commercial structure per model: host-partner (fixed lease/ground-lease per bay, or kWh-revenue-share, or hybrid + traffic/host fee); own-operate (kWh tariff + time-based idle fee + loyalty redemption per VS-13); define who pays for energy, demand-charges, maintenance, insurance, and upgrades
Responsible (R): Finance / EV Program / Legal
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Per model + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4772_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4772_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4772_Task5" name="Build the unit economics: host-revenue vs cost (lease foregone on the parking…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Build the unit economics: host-revenue vs cost (lease foregone on the parking bay, energy, demand-charge, maintenance, insurance, capex amortization), basket-uplift attribution, and the break-even utilization; define the revenue-share/lease terms in the CPO contract (W4770) and the tariff (W4775)
Responsible (R): Finance / EV Program
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4772_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4772_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4772_Task6" name="Govern settlement and revenue recognition: host-revenue/lease income…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern settlement and revenue recognition: host-revenue/lease income recognition (PFRS 15 VS-157 for own-operate kWh sales; lease accounting VS-148 for host-lease); reconcile CPO revenue-share settlements; manage intercompany if BuildRight Digital/Logistics entities are involved (VS-72)
Responsible (R): Finance / Treasury / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4772_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4772_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4772_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4772_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4772_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-719 (ensure controlled execution — Charging Network Strategy, Siting &amp; Host Partnering (PA-163.1).) | - CTL-719: commercial structure per Finance/Legal-reviewed unit economics; PFRS 15/lease accounting applied (VS-157/VS-148); settlements reconciled
Owner: EV Program Manager / Finance (VS-17.4) / Real Estate (VS-97)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
