    <bpmn:process id="W_W4773" name="W4773. EV Customer Experience, Loyalty Integration &amp; Drive-to-Store Basket Design" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site launch; CX program (VS-13); loyalty/CRM refresh (VS-126)
Frequency: Per phase + continuous optimization
Volume: 1 group CX design; ~across all charging sites
Owner: EV Program Manager / Marketing &amp; CX (VS-14/VS-13)
Participants: Loyalty/CRM (VS-13/VS-126), App (VS-75), Merchandising (basket), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4773 — EV Customer Experience, Loyalty Integration &amp; Drive-to-Store Basket Design</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4773_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4773_Lane1" name="Marketing">
