      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4773_Start4" name="Site launch; CX program (VS-13); loyalty/CRM refresh (VS-126)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4773_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4773_Task5" name="Design the EV-driver customer journey: discovery (app VS-75, mapping/roaming…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the EV-driver customer journey: discovery (app VS-75, mapping/roaming apps, signage VS-14), arrival/wayfinding to the charge bay, plug-in/charging start (RFID/app/QR via W4783), the dwell experience (in-store shopping, waiting area, restrooms, F&amp;B), charging-complete notification, and unplug/idle-fee nudge
Responsible (R): Marketing / CX / EV Program
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / EV Program Manager
Duration: Per phase</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4773_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4773_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4773_Task6" name="Integrate loyalty &amp; personalization (VS-13/VS-126/VS-75): loyalty points on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Integrate loyalty &amp; personalization (VS-13/VS-126/VS-75): loyalty points on charging spend, charging-status in the app, &quot;charge-while-you-shop&quot; offers, targeted basket promotions during dwell, and EV-driver segment in the CDP (VS-126); design the basket-attach offer (e.g., charging discount with minimum store spend)
Responsible (R): Marketing / Loyalty / EV Program
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Per phase + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4773_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4773_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4773_Task7" name="Measure and optimize the EV-driver CX and basket-uplift: NPS for EV drivers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Measure and optimize the EV-driver CX and basket-uplift: NPS for EV drivers (VS-13), charge-to-purchase conversion, dwell→basket attribution, idle/occupancy friction; feed to analytics (W4792) and continuous improvement (VS-133)
Responsible (R): CX / Analytics / Marketing
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager / VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4773_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4773_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4773_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4773_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
