    <bpmn:process id="W_W4774" name="W4774. Regulatory &amp; Utility Engagement — ERC, RA 11697, Meralco/Cooperative, LGU" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site feasibility (W4771); deployment (W4781); regulatory change; ERC/LGU engagement
Frequency: Per site + on regulation change
Volume: ~205 sites across multiple utilities/LGUs
Owner: EV Program Manager / Compliance (VS-22) / Energy (VS-120)
Participants: ERC (Energy Regulatory Commission), Meralco/electric cooperatives, LGU, Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W4774 — Regulatory &amp; Utility Engagement — ERC, RA 11697, Meralco/Cooperative, LGU</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4774_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4774_Lane1" name="Energy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4774_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4774_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
