        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4774_Start4" name="Site feasibility (W4771); deployment (W4781); regulatory change; ERC/LGU engagement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4774_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4774_Task5" name="Engage the distribution utility (Meralco in NCR/CALABARZON; electric…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Engage the distribution utility (Meralco in NCR/CALABARZON; electric cooperatives in provinces) for service connection/upgrades to support charging loads; negotiate demand-charge management, time-of-use, and net-metering for own solar (VS-108); manage the ERC regulatory interface for any own-generation/selling-energy arrangements
Responsible (R): Energy / EV Program / Legal
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager / Legal
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4774_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4774_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4774_Task6" name="Maintain compliance with the EV regulatory map: RA 11697 (EVIDA) and its IRR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain compliance with the EV regulatory map: RA 11697 (EVIDA) and its IRR (charging-infrastructure mandates for certain buildings/parking, EV-fleet share), the EVIDA Comprehensive Roadmap, DOTr/DOTP EV standards, LGU permits for charging installations, and the PWD-accessibility requirement for charge bays (RA 7277/BP 344)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / EV Program
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager / Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4774_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4774_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4774_Task7" name="Manage LGU permits and inspections for charging-station installations, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage LGU permits and inspections for charging-station installations, the electrical (Philippine Electrical Code) inspection/certification of EVSE, and any &quot;selling electricity as a service&quot; regulatory classification (vs BuildRight&#x27;s retail charter — coordinate with VS-156 financial-agency/VS-80 payment-operations precedent); records per VS-88
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / Facilities
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager / Legal
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4774_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4774_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4774_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4774_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
