        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-719 (ensure controlled execution — Charging Network Strategy, Siting &amp; Host Partnering (PA-163.1).) | - CTL-719 (utility connection confirmed before deployment; RA 11697/ERC/LGU compliance maintained; PWD-accessible bays; permits recorded (VS-88))
Owner: EV Program Manager / Compliance (VS-22) / Energy (VS-120)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
