    <bpmn:process id="W_W4775" name="W4775. Charging Tariff Design, Energy Pricing &amp; Demand-Charge Management Strategy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Own-operate model (W4769); energy-cost change; demand-charge review
Frequency: Periodic review + on energy-cost change
Volume: 1 tariff structure (own-operate sites)
Owner: EV Program Manager / Energy (VS-120) / Finance
Participants: Finance (VS-17), Treasury (VS-18), Energy (VS-108/VS-120), CPO
Source: workflow W4775 — Charging Tariff Design, Energy Pricing &amp; Demand-Charge Management Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4775_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4775_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4775_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4775_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4775_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4775_Lane2" name="Energy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4775_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4775_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4775_Start4" name="Own-operate model (W4769); energy-cost change; demand-charge review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4775_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4775_Task5" name="Design the charging tariff: per-kWh energy price (covering utility energy +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the charging tariff: per-kWh energy price (covering utility energy + demand-charge + EVSE amortization + margin), time-of-use pricing (peak/off-peak to shape demand), idle/occupancy fee (to free bays after charge-complete), and loyalty-redemption integration (VS-13); benchmark against the CPO/host-network market
Responsible (R): Finance / Energy / EV Program
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4775_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4775_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4775_Task6" name="Manage demand-charges and peak load: use BuildRight&#x27;s own solar/storage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage demand-charges and peak load: use BuildRight&#x27;s own solar/storage (VS-108) for peak-shaving, smart-load-management (throttle charge-rate during site peak), scheduled charging, and buffer storage to avoid demand-charge triggers; coordinate with the RA 11285 energy program (VS-120)
Responsible (R): Energy / EV Program / Facilities
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4775_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4775_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4775_Task7" name="Govern energy cost recovery and margin: track utility kWh + demand-charge vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern energy cost recovery and margin: track utility kWh + demand-charge vs charging-revenue, manage FX on imported EVSE/spares, and re-price the tariff on energy-cost movement; feed tariff/margin performance to analytics (W4792)
Responsible (R): Finance / Treasury / Energy
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4775_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4775_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4775_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4775_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4775_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-719 (ensure controlled execution — Charging Network Strategy, Siting &amp; Host Partnering (PA-163.1).) | - CTL-719: tariff covers cost-recovery + margin; demand-charge managed via solar/storage; idle-fee enforced; re-priced on energy-cost change
Owner: EV Program Manager / Energy (VS-120) / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
