    <bpmn:process id="W_W4776" name="W4776. Network Expansion Governance, Capex Approval &amp; Portfolio Prioritization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Phase rollout (W4769); annual capex cycle; performance review (W4792)
Frequency: Annual + per phase
Volume: 1 portfolio governance; ~phased capex
Owner: EV Program Manager / PMO (VS-112) / Finance
Participants: PMO (VS-112), Capex (VS-40), Real Estate (VS-97), Strategy (VS-33)
Source: workflow W4776 — Network Expansion Governance, Capex Approval &amp; Portfolio Prioritization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4776_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4776_Lane1" name="EV Program">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4776_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4776_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4776_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4776_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4776_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4776_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4776_Start4" name="Phase rollout (W4769); annual capex cycle; performance review (W4792)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4776_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4776_Task5" name="Maintain the charging-portfolio roadmap and capex pipeline: candidate sites…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the charging-portfolio roadmap and capex pipeline: candidate sites (W4771), phased rollout aligned to EV adoption and store-remodel/new-store programs (VS-109/VS-37), own-operate vs host-partner mix, and the multi-year capex envelope; integrate into the corporate capex plan (VS-40/VS-112)
Responsible (R): EV Program / PMO / Finance
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4776_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4776_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4776_Task6" name="Govern capex approval per the tiered matrix (VS-40): business case…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govern capex approval per the tiered matrix (VS-40): business case (W4769/W4772), ROI/utilization thresholds, phase-gate review (deploy → measure utilization/basket-uplift → decide next phase); escalate material capex to the board (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Finance / PMO / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO / CFO / Board
Duration: Per phase</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4776_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4776_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4776_Task7" name="Prioritize the portfolio dynamically using performance data (W4792): reallocate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Prioritize the portfolio dynamically using performance data (W4792): reallocate capex from under-performing to over-performing sites/regions, adjust the own-operate/host mix, and feed learnings back to the strategy (W4769); manage dependencies with energy (VS-108), facilities (VS-138), and real-estate (VS-97) programs
Responsible (R): EV Program / PMO / Analytics
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4776_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4776_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4776_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4776_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4776_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-719 (ensure controlled execution — Charging Network Strategy, Siting &amp; Host Partnering (PA-163.1).) | - CTL-719: capex via tiered approval matrix (VS-40); phase-gate review before each release; portfolio reallocation on performance data
Owner: EV Program Manager / PMO (VS-112) / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
